{"id":278428301814016,"type":"album","name":"FLYGOD","artist":"Westside Gunn","year":2016,"weight":14,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/51679-flygod_152550.jpg","aoty":83,"yt":"VaSfaO2Ef5E","links":{"aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/51679-westside-gunn-flygod.php"},"desc":"FLYGOD is Buffalo rapper Westside Gunn’s debut album released on March 11, 2016 and was influential towards the New York underground along with introducing the world properly to Gunn and his Griselda crew. The album’s themes are mainly laced with griminess, self reflection, wealth, flossing and in general introducing to you who Gunn is, his experience, what he lives through and has had to live through, plus how he can floss really well. Its set on a balance between the vanity, the grimy and the at times thoughtful. The album is focused on either jazzy, lo-fi or unsettling instrumentals mostly ."},"artist_ref":{"id":213245266902015,"name":"Westside Gunn","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":138496995988479,"type":"genre","name":"Hardcore Hip Hop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":261,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":39329334330192,"type":"genre","name":"East Coast Hip Hop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":251,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":11032604610676,"type":"genre","name":"Mafioso Rap","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":100,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":159643507926529,"type":"genre","name":"Coke Rap","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":53,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":6898734097364,"name":"RYM Top — Hip Hop — Coke Rap","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":11,"year":null,"note":null,"total":51,"scaruffi":null},{"id":182721199555464,"name":"RYM Top — Hip Hop — Mafioso Rap","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":13,"year":null,"note":null,"total":98,"scaruffi":null},{"id":50051288032588,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 2016","src":"musthear","grp":"sputnikmusic","list_year":null,"rank":47,"year